---
layout: base.njk
pageType: home
title: Roofing in West Wales
titleFull: "West Wales Roofing | Slate, Tile & Flat Roofs"
description: Roofers covering Carmarthenshire and Ceredigion. Re-roofs, new builds, flat roofs, historic slate and storm damage. Free quotes — call 07956 091794.
permalink: /index.html
---
{% set jobs = collections.jobs | featuredFirst %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <div class="hero-card">
      <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-red">Slate &middot; Tile &middot; Flat &middot; West Wales</div>
      <h1>Every roof we finish goes on this site.</h1>
      <p>{{ jobs.length }} jobs on the books this year, photographed start to finish. Have a look at the work, then ring us.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-red" href="/work/">Browse the work</a>
        <a class="btn btn-line" href="/contact/">Get a quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap sec">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <h2>Recent jobs</h2>
    <a class="sec-more" href="/work/">All {{ jobs.length }} jobs &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <div class="job-grid">
    {% for job in jobs.slice(0, 3) %}
    <a class="job-card" href="{{ job.url }}">
      <div class="job-thumb">
        {% if job.data.hero %}<img src="{{ job.data.hero }}" alt="{{ job.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
        {% else %}<span>{{ job.data.photoLabel }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="job-cat">{{ job.data.category }}</div>
      <div class="job-card-title">{{ job.data.title }}</div>
      <p>{{ job.data.overview }}</p>
      <div class="job-meta">{{ job.data.system }} &middot; {{ job.data.duration }}</div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap band-in">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
      <h2>A small firm, still run off the tools.</h2>
      <p>{{ site.name }} is {{ site.owner }} and a small crew working across {{ site.areasLong }}. Slate, tile, flat roofs and storm work &mdash; on houses, farm buildings, chapels and commercial units.</p>
      <p>{{ site.owner }} quotes every job himself and is on site for most of it. No subcontracted crews, no sales calls.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:22px"><a class="sec-more" href="/about/">Read {{ site.owner }}'s story &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">What we do</div>
      <div class="svc">
        {% for s in site.services %}
        <div class="row"><div class="name">{{ s.name }}</div><div class="note">{{ s.note }}</div></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap cta-in">
    <div>
      <h2>Need a roof looked at?</h2>
      <p>Free look, honest answer, written quote.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-white" href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact/">Send an enquiry</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
